UPDATE "families" SET "name" = 'Reach Trucks', "summary" = 'Narrow-aisle electric trucks that reach into racking and lift high, packing more storage into the same warehouse floor.', "how_it_works" = 'A **reach truck** is designed to store pallets high in narrow aisles. A counterbalance forklift carries its load in front of the front wheels and needs a wide aisle to turn. A reach truck instead has two **outrigger legs** with load wheels that stretch forward from the chassis. The mast moves forward along the legs (a **moving-mast** design) to pick or place a pallet, then pulls back so the load sits within the truck''s wheelbase while it travels and turns.

**Why it needs less space.** The load is carried inside the footprint and the truck pivots around a central drive wheel, so it can make a right-angle turn into racking in a much narrower aisle than a counterbalance truck. Lift heights are usually higher too, using three-stage masts.

**Drive and hydraulics.** A single steered drive wheel under the operator compartment is powered by an AC traction motor. A separate pump motor supplies the hydraulic circuit for lift, reach, tilt and side-shift. The operator sits sideways or stands, depending on the model, so both travel directions are easy to see.

**Battery.** BYD''s reach trucks use lithium iron phosphate (LFP) batteries. The RTR series uses 80 V packs and the R15PS/R18PS models use 48 V packs. Because LFP accepts opportunity charging, operators can top up at breaks instead of changing batteries. The BMS manages cell balance and temperature.

**Height and stability.** At height, the truck''s capacity falls and the mast flexes more. Reach trucks therefore have load charts specific to each mast and height. Many also use speed and lift-height interlocks, and some offer height pre-selection or tilt-at-height limits.', "order" = 3 WHERE "slug" = 'reach-trucks';
--> statement-breakpoint
UPDATE "products" SET "name" = 'RTR16', "summary" = '1.6 t seated reach truck, described by BYD Singapore as a sitting reach truck.', "highlights" = '["Seated operator position", "1,600 kg at 500 mm load centre", "LFP battery, 270 / 340 Ah listed", "1,758 mm turning radius"]'::jsonb, "specs" = '{"ratedCapacity": 1600, "loadCentre": 500, "operatorPosition": "Seated", "voltage": 80, "batteryCapacity": "270 / 340", "turningRadius": 1758, "serviceWeight": 4070}'::jsonb, "specs_verified" = true, "order" = 0 WHERE "slug" = 'byd-rtr16';
