UPDATE "families" SET "name" = 'Pallet Stackers', "summary" = 'Compact 1.4 t electric stackers that lift pallets onto racking where a full forklift is too big or not justified.', "how_it_works" = 'An **electric pallet stacker** sits between a pallet truck and a forklift. Like a pallet truck, it uses a tiller and a single steered drive wheel. It also has a **mast**, so it can lift pallets onto racking, mezzanines and truck beds.

**Stability without a counterweight.** Most stackers do not balance the load with a heavy counterweight. They use **straddle legs** or base arms with load wheels under or around the pallet. The load sits inside the truck''s wheelbase, which keeps the stacker short and light. Because of this, the pallet type and rack bottom beam must suit the leg design.

**Lift system.** An AC or DC pump motor drives a hydraulic pump. The pump feeds the lift cylinder or cylinders, which extend a two- or three-stage mast through chains and pulleys. A proportional valve controls the lowering speed. Some models have an **initial lift**: the base arms rise a little on their own, so the truck can carry two pallets at once (one on the arms, one on the forks) or clear uneven dock plates.

**Drive and braking.** An AC traction motor drives the steered wheel, and the controller provides regenerative slowing. An electromagnetic brake applies when the tiller is released or moved to its upper or lower position.

**Battery and charging.** BYD''s stackers run on 24 V lithium iron phosphate (LFP) batteries with a BMS. An on-board charger is standard on its European EPS14 series, and a faster external charger is an option. Short charges during breaks keep the truck working through a shift.

**Operator position.** Pedestrian stackers suit occasional lifting. Stand-on models with fold-down platforms and side guards cover longer distances at higher speed.', "order" = 4 WHERE "slug" = 'stackers';
--> statement-breakpoint
UPDATE "products" SET "name" = 'S14PS', "summary" = '1.4 t stand-on electric stacker on a 24 V LFP battery.', "highlights" = '["1,400 kg capacity", "24 V 210 Ah LFP battery", "1,490 mm turning radius"]'::jsonb, "specs" = '{"ratedCapacity": 1400, "operatorPosition": "Stand-on platform", "voltage": 24, "batteryCapacity": 210, "turningRadius": 1490, "serviceWeight": 1180}'::jsonb, "specs_verified" = true, "order" = 1 WHERE "slug" = 'byd-s14ps';
